  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SUPPORT TO INTEGRATED CLIMATE SMART LIVELIHOODS</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of the climate-smart livelihood programme is to strengthen the resilience of vulnerable communities&apos; livelihoods to climate change, alleviate chronic food insecurity, and restore degraded natural resource systems in Tigray region. ICRAF lead on the Agroforestry component, as part of a consortium. In particular, the focus is more of creating tree based watersheds, evergreen agriculture, land reclamation,  tree nursery development, plantation of mutli-purpose trees in rehablitated structures for ecological and economic benefits, area ex-closure for protection of trees and grazing land enrichment.</narrative>
  </description>
